NNAAMMEE
     aaww__ssyyssccoonn — driver for the system controller in Allwinner SoC

DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The aaww__ssyyssccoonn device driver provides support for the Allwinner system
     controller.  This controller provides registers for tying together re‐
     lated functionality in a common space.  aaww__ssyyssccoonn is required for ether‐
     net functionality on supported devices.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The aaww__ssyyssccoonn driver supports the system controller with one of the fol‐
     lowing compatible strings:

     ••   allwinner,sun50i-a64-system-controller
     ••   allwinner,sun8i-a83t-system-controller
     ••   allwinner,sun8i-h3-system-controller

